  "description": "EMAIL ESQUIRIES ONLY\n\nA stunning two bed duplex apartment in the quiet and peaceful town of Passage West. Only a short drive from both Douglas Village and Ringaskiddy.\n\nThis beautiful apartment offers two double bed rooms, one with an en-suite, a bathroom, kitchen and a large living / dining room, and office. \n\nProperty Features \n- 2 Double bedrooms\n- 2 Bathrooms\n- Quiet gated apartment building\n- Comfortable, well located apartment\n- Available from the 1st of October \n- No Pets\n\nApplication Requirements \n\nApplicants are asked to provide the following information when making an enquiry :\n\n- A brief introduction/bio about yourself and other tenants \n- Landlord &  References\n- Photo ID / Passport\n\nPlease include as much relevant information as possible in your initial enquiry.\nPlease note we may not be able to reply to all enquiries.\n\nPSRA No : 001914",
